#   common_subsequence_size(?Size, ?Length): sized by the readings of the
#   direct point (a probe of 2026-09-30, CPU 11, 20 s): weak_head
#   reads length 12 in 2085 ms and stops at 40; tabling(weak_head) reads 12
#   in 22 ms, 40 in 344 ms and 150 in 5385 ms and stops at 400, where the
#   native dynamic programme (longest_common_subsequence/3) takes 31 ms. So
